{"id":"b05025919ce89136","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-zfc-recursion3-turing-reduction.md","title":"ZFC Recursion3 Turing Reduction","display":"df-zfc-recursion3-turing-reduction — ZFC Recursion3 Turing Reduction","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-recursion3-turing-reduction","aliases":["58-df-zfc-recursion3-turing-reduction","58-df-zfc-comp-turing-reduction"],"display":"df-zfc-recursion3-turing-reduction — ZFC Recursion3 Turing Reduction","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-recursion2-oracle-computation.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-recursion3-turing-reduction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-recursion3-turing-reduction</span><span>58-df-zfc-comp-turing-reduction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-recursion3-turing-reduction — ZFC Recursion3 Turing Reduction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1d725a0797bae6df\" href=\"?note=1d725a0797bae6df\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-zfc-recursion2-oracle-computation.md\">../batch03/58-df-zfc-recursion2-oracle-computation.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in V\">\\(A,B\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,n,m\\in\\omega\">\\(e,n,m\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2OracleComputation}_S(m,e,B,n)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2OracleComputation}_S(m,e,B,n)\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1d725a0797bae6df\" href=\"?note=1d725a0797bae6df\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-zfc-recursion2-oracle-computation.md\">../batch03/58-df-zfc-recursion2-oracle-computation.md</a> 的固定程序编号及有限执行语义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OracleOutput}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\">\\(\\operatorname{OracleOutput}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\)</span> 保留原名称与四参数顺序；它是下式定义的集合论谓词，不再是未指定的外部关系。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3TuringReduction}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3TuringReduction}_S\\)</span> 保留二元接口。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OracleOutput}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(m,e,B,n)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2OracleComputation}_S(m,e,B,n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{OracleOutput}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(m,e,B,n)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2OracleComputation}_S(m,e,B,n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion3\\text{-}turing\\text{-}reduction}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3TuringReduction}_S(A,B)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;A\\subseteq\\omega\\land B\\subseteq\\omega\\land\n\\exists e\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl[\n(n\\in A\\land\\operatorname{OracleOutput}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(1,e,B,n))\\lor\n(n\\notin A\\land\\operatorname{OracleOutput}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(0,e,B,n))\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion3\\text{-}turing\\text{-}reduction}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3TuringReduction}_S(A,B)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;A\\subseteq\\omega\\land B\\subseteq\\omega\\land\n\\exists e\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl[\n(n\\in A\\land\\operatorname{OracleOutput}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(1,e,B,n))\\lor\n(n\\notin A\\land\\operatorname{OracleOutput}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(0,e,B,n))\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>原有集合、程序编号和归约方向保持不变；通过内部四元计算关系消除未定义的“可接受编号”依赖。旧 Remark 所称依赖环在本次输入的依赖图中已不存在。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-omega.md","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-zfc-recursion2-oracle-computation.md","status":"resolved","id":"1d725a0797bae6df","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-recursion2-oracle-computation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-zfc-recursion2-oracle-computation.md","status":"resolved","id":"1d725a0797bae6df","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2OracleComputation}_S(m,e,B,n)$ 使用 [[../batch03/58-df-zfc-recursion2-oracle-computation.md]] 的固定程序编号及有限执行语义。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"e,n,m\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2OracleComputation}_S(m,e,B,n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{OracleOutput}_{\\mathsf{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3TuringReduction}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{OracleOutput}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(m,e,B,n)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2OracleComputation}_S(m,e,B,n).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion3\\text{-}turing\\text{-}reduction}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3TuringReduction}_S(A,B)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&A\\subseteq\\omega\\land B\\subseteq\\omega\\land\n\\exists e\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl[\n(n\\in A\\land\\operatorname{OracleOutput}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(1,e,B,n))\\lor\n(n\\notin A\\land\\operatorname{OracleOutput}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(0,e,B,n))\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1703,"backlinks":[{"id":"da4d430c6154e318","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3255","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-recursion3-turing-reduction.md|58-df-zfc-recursion3-turing-reduction]]（batch02）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","5045d216c83e75cb","1d725a0797bae6df"]}